{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d422c969-715f-85c8-870c-e42f61a72312",
  "created_at": "2026-01-06T11:04:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sean Flynn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:57:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, City of Newport Finance Department, this is Janet Whitcomb. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:57:24-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, um, yeah. Good morning. Well, I got transferred a couple times, and before that the phone menu, I swear, sounded like a game show. Press one, press two, do you want to phone a friend. Anyway. I'm calling about a parking ticket."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:57:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. I can help with parking citations. Do you have the ticket in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:57:51-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I've got it right here. Um, it's a, it says parked within too close of a fire hydrant. Or something like that. Violation was last Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:58:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Could you read me the citation number from the top of the ticket, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:58:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, hold on. Um, it's, okay, P as in Paul, K, then 4, 4, 8, 1, 0, 2."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:58:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Let me read that back to you. P, K, 4, 4, 8, 1, 0, 2. Is that correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:58:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:58:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And may I have your name as it appears on the registration?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:58:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sean Flynn. F-L-Y-N-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:58:39-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Flynn. One moment while I pull that up. [pause] Yes, I have it. The citation was issued Friday morning for parking too close to a hydrant. The amount due is shown on the notice. Did you want to discuss the ticket?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:58:58-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, yeah. So, um, here's my problem. I don't think I was too close. Like, I know where the hydrant is, and I measured it, well, I paced it, and I was at least, I'd say, a car length and a half away. The officer must've eyeballed it or something. It wasn't right up on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:59:23-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. The officer's notes indicate the vehicle was within the distance required from the hydrant. If you wish to dispute the citation, there is a process for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:59:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Um, what is the process? Because I'm not, I don't want to take a whole day off work for this. It's like a pain, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:59:48-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A contest of the citation is typically requested in writing or in person, and it is reviewed. The notice on the back of your ticket lists the steps and the deadline. Would you like me to go over what it says?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:00:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, sure. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:00:09-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The back of the ticket should list payment options and an option to request a hearing. You would need to do that within the window printed there. Please check the date on the front as well, because the deadline is counted from the issue date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:00:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, um, it says, hold on, it says fourteen days to, uh, respond or whatever. Then it gets bigger. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:00:39-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would rely on what is printed on your notice. Generally, yes, if a citation is not resolved by the stated date, a late charge may be added."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:00:52-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. So, well, let me ask you this. Is there any way, since this is my first ticket, like ever, here in Newport, to get the fine waived? Like a first-time thing? Because I've never had one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:01:09-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not have the authority to waive a fine over the phone, Mr. Flynn. A request for a reduction or dismissal would be considered as part of the review. You could include in your request that this is your first citation."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:01:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So it's not automatic. It's like, I have to ask for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:01:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's correct. It is not applied automatically. The reviewer decides."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:01:39-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. That's, okay. Kind of annoying, because, I mean, it's like forty-some, well, whatever the amount is, for something I barely did. But fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:01:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand your frustration. Would you like to submit your contest now, or would you prefer to send it in with a statement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:02:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I do it over the phone? Like, right now, with you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:02:07-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can note your call on the account, but the formal request needs to be in writing. You may bring it to the window at City Hall or mail it. I can tell you where to address it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:02:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail it, I guess. Um, where do I send it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:02:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Address it to the City of Newport, Finance Department, Parking Citations, at City Hall. Include your citation number, your name, your phone number, and a description of why you dispute it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:02:43-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, um, can I send a photo? Like I could go back and take a picture of where the car was parked and where the hydrant is, with a tape measure or something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:02:58-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, photographs are very helpful. Please print them and include them with your letter. Taking a photo with a tape measure showing the distance would be a good idea."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:03:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Well, I'll do that this week. And I'll mention the first-time thing in the letter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:03:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Very good. Shall I note a callback number on the account in case the reviewer needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:03:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0173."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:03:30-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. That is 401-555-0173. I have noted that you called regarding citation P, K, 4, 4, 8, 1, 0, 2 and that you intend to contest it in writing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:03:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Um, and does that, like, pause the clock? On the late fee?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:03:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A note on the account does not extend the deadline. Your written request should reach us before the date printed on the ticket."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:04:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I gotta get it in quick. Got it. Well, I'll do it tomorrow, then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:04:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would be wise. Is there anything else I can assist you with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:04:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's, um, that's it. Thanks for your help, Ms. Whitcomb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:04:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Flynn. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:04:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
